  "description": "## ☀️ Worshippers of the Sun\n\nA casual/laidback guild that focuses on having fun, but still has a competitive side.\n\n#### 🌄 Sunriser of the Week\n- **Op3y**\n\n\n#### 💬 Discord\n- Everyone is welcome to join our IMMO community: \nhttps://discord.gg/mnMFr6beC9\n\n#### 🎁 Guild Benefits\n- Weekly item giveaways to raid participants. Including: Dragonblood Tonic, Wraithbane Essence, and more! (Winner obtains the title: Sunriser of the Week)\n- Friendly, and easy-going community.\n- Organized and consistent raid schedule with maximum rewards.\n\n#### ✅ Member Requirements\n- **Combat level must be equal or more than 80.**\n- Active within the game. Inactivity for 3+ days without notice will result in being kicked.\n- Raid participation when possible, preferably at least one main raid per day.\n- Be respectful towards members and all other players.\n- Discord guild server participation is highly recommended for all members.\n- Chew 5 Gum™.\n\n#### 🏆 Guild Achievements\n- Created on the first day Guilds were released\n- First guild to offer giveaways\n\n#### 🗓️ Raid Schedule\n- 9:30 AM ET\n- 5:00 PM ET\n\n**Stay sunny!** 🌞",
